window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Step into this paranormal romance audiobook, brought to life by Corvin King.</b></p> <p>Rain has lost nearly everything in the last decade. Her grandmother, her brother, and now the home that holds their memories. Her only constant is Graham, the powerful Fae who knows her heart better than she wants to admit.</p> <p>Then Ezra steps into her life, a breathtaking Vampire who offers her a job cleansing an abandoned mansion full of vengeful spirits. A job that could give Rain something she desperately needs: a chance to save her home.</p> <p>As passions ignite and loyalties blur, Rain must navigate a supernatural world where she's never quite fit, while juggling powerful men who've become impossible to ignore.</p> <p>But Rain isn't the only one with secrets...</p>"; 
